<p>Kubernetes is the preferred deployment; the Mac path is for people moving from OpenClaw or Hermes.</p>
<p>Every path installs the same two daemons, <code>dekopon-gatewayd</code> and <code>dekopon-brokerd</code>. Pick an environment, give the broker a provider and a grant, then check both configurations.</p>
